1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,036
Muscle cells, or fibres, are packed with two protein filaments, actin and myosin, that slide to make the cell shorten.

2
00:00:09,036 --> 00:00:10,924
There are three kinds.

3
00:00:10,924 --> 00:00:19,322
Striated, or skeletal, muscle: long unbranched cylinders, striped, with many nuclei at the edge.

4
00:00:19,322 --> 00:00:23,528
It is voluntary, fast, powerful, and it tires.

